{
  "description": "What a reader keeps of a manifest's doors_elsewhere: each case's manifest gives kept. Every entry is checked alone and dropped alone: an item type of the five, not one the manifest lists in item_types and not one an entry kept before it names; a URL kept as written, https, at most 2048 characters, with no user or password, on a host of two labels or more whose last label starts with a letter. Since 0.9.0 an entry's platform is kept when vocab/door-platforms.json knows the token, the platform takes that kind and the URL is the business's own page there (one of its pages, or past its home and reserved names), or the platform serves pages on the business's own domain and the URL's host is on the website the manifest's profile.url names; otherwise the platform alone is dropped. detect gives, for a URL and a kind, the platform doorPlatformOf finds (null for none) and the name doorPlace gives the door; clean gives the tracking and affiliate parameters doorTrackingParams finds and the URL cleanDoorUrl leaves, every other parameter exactly as written; generic names a platform may use on its own direct link, like ref, are kept. Read by packages/core/test/doors-elsewhere.test.ts and packages/spec/test/door-platforms.test.ts.",
